{"id":"vod_sn_37575","vodId":"37575","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"摸索吧！部活剧","name_cn":"摸索吧！部活剧","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/72e504e25aa2bf6fc72217a67bb7075c.jpg"},"summary":"新学年，桃成高中迎来了高一新生，各个社团纷纷摆出摊位，招揽新丁。这喧嚣的校园一角，一个颇有些奇怪的社团置身其中。天真烂漫的社长铃木结爱（西明日香 配音）、学习超好且温柔随和副社长佐藤阳菜（明坂聪美 配音）以及自由散漫的二年级高桥葵（荻野可铃 配音），因为苦苦思索想不出该加入什么社团，而最终成立了摸索社。为了配合日常系的节奏，摸索社的三名女孩强拉硬拽吸收了高一新生田中心春（大桥彩香 配音）加入进来，担当吐槽角色。国中时代没有参加任何社团的心春，虽然想体验社团活动，可是真心没想到会遇见这么不着调的几个前辈。浓浓的日常系气息，心春和前辈们的摸索社部活正式启动……　　本片根据たつき的原作改编。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:53:39","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/7vgbE7v66z1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/6UvQiUEY6Q1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/AbN9YX4Gex1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/8fHxTnfnVp1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/tMgjUpZCkq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/D3i83xzmJs1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/KJh3Yfm27v1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/PQ2zRC3hUM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/Zc33D0h1TH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/bX3V41j5bQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/ZMLVjq6u9c1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/KZHsDrp6Ha1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:09.250Z"}